  "construction": {
    "basis": "instructions",
    "fidelity": "adapted",
    "note": "The sequence follows Mamoot’s Ibn Tulun window lesson: triangles, three squares, twelve-pointed star, fish and two bending stars. The work log records an exact final-ink overlay.",
    "changes": "The source does not fully specify the fish and bending-star endpoints in words. Those details were measured from its step drawings and expressed as exact crossings and parallel lines. We use its clover repeat.",
